### S05 · RECURSOS (resource-service :3005)
### ============================================================================

### S05.01 Categorías -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/recursos/categorias?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### S05.02 Estados (is_bookable) -> 200
