Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### S05.03 Listar recursos (paginado, filtros categoryId / campusUuid) -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/recursos/recursos?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### S05.04 Detalle de recurso -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/recursos/recursos/{{resourceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### S05.05 Horarios semanales del recurso -> 200
