GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/reservas/{{reservaId}}/historial
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### S06.06 Crear reserva -> 201 (arranca en pending: AULA requires_approval = 1)
# @name createReserva
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/reservas
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "bookingTypeId": {{tipoReservaId}},
  "resourceId": {{resourceId}},
  "title": "Reserva desde coleccion REST Client",
  "description": "Peticion preparada para repetir la prueba de integracion",
  "bookingDate": "2026-11-26",
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "endTime": "11:00",
  "expectedAttendees": 20
}

### S06.07 Conflicto de horario (mismo recurso, franja superpuesta) -> 409
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/reservas
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "bookingTypeId": {{tipoReservaId}},
  "resourceId": {{resourceId}},
  "title": "Intento solapado",
  "bookingDate": "2026-11-26",
  "startTime": "10:00",
  "endTime": "12:00"
}


