Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### S11.02 Metadata de un archivo -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/archivos/archivos/{{fileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### S11.03 Descargar contenido -> 200 (Content-Type original)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/archivos/archivos/{{fileId}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### S11.04 Subir archivo (multipart/form-data) -> 201
# @name uploadArchivo
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/archivos/archivos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----UajsQaBoundary

------UajsQaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="coleccion-rest-client.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

Contenido de prueba de la coleccion REST Client.
------UajsQaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ownerType"

solicitud
------UajsQaBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="metadata"

{"origen": "01-gateway.http"}
------UajsQaBoundary--


### ============================================================================
### S12 · NEGATIVOS DEL GATEWAY
### ============================================================================

### S12.01 Ruta inexistente -> 404 (errorHandler del gateway, no del proxy)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/no-existe
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### S12.02 Token corrupto -> 401
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/usuarios/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.token.invalido

### S12.03 Cuerpo inválido en reserva (endTime anterior a startTime) -> 400
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/reservas
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "bookingTypeId": {{tipoReservaId}},
  "resourceId": {{resourceId}},
  "title": "Horario invalido",
  "bookingDate": "2026-11-26",
  "startTime": "11:00",
  "endTime": "09:00"
}


